OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment may support 'crucial'
OL,4,AHeathrow link
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Jersey minister says an all-year
OL,7,FBritish Airways link to London is
OL,8,Fessential to the island's economy and
OL,9,Fthe government will consider using
OL,10,Fpublic money to make sure it is
OL,11,Fmaintained.
OL,13,FMinister for External Relations Ian
OL,14,FGorst told a States scrutiny panel it
OL,15,Fwas "absolutely critical to our
OL,16,Feconomic future".
OL,18,FHe said good transport links were
OL,19,Fessential for the island to remain
OL,20,Fcompetitive for businesses.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
