OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment may support 'crucial'
OL,4,AHeathrow link
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenator Gorst told the Economic
OL,7,FDevelopment and International Affairs
OL,8,FPanel: "I believe it is so critical
OL,9,Fthat if Ports of Jersey need financial
OL,10,Fsupport to deliver and maintain those,
OL,11,Fthen I'm prepared and I think it is the
OL,12,Fright use of the competitiveness fund
OL,13,Fto support that."
